				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The Cisco switch must be configured to protect audit information from unauthorized deletion.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
